(4702269, 677366, 36006, '<td valign="top">Ya know, I am sorry, but this is way too sharp for this challenge.<br/> <br/>This image is, however, a great image, even though you have tried to shoehorn it in.<br/> <br/>Color is very nice and not distracting, light excellent, dof excellent, comp. excellent, texture excellent, highlight and shadow is again excellent.<br/> <br/>Because this image is too sharp, it is not anymore than a midrange contender imo.<br/> <br/>good luck.</td>', 'Ya know, I am sorry, but this is way too sharp for this challenge. This image is, however, a great image, even though you have tried to shoehorn it in. Color is very nice and not distracting, light excellent, dof excellent, comp. excellent, texture excellent, highlight and shadow is again excellent. Because this image is too sharp, it is not anymore than a midrange contender imo. good luck.', '2008-05-14 15:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
