(4702495, 677871, 49804, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous shot, great shallow dof, love the colors too, but the shot isn''t really soft focus, the main part is nailed in focus, this is more of "bokeh" instead of "soft focus", nonetheless a shot to be proud of.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous shot, great shallow dof, love the colors too, but the shot isn''t really soft focus, the main part is nailed in focus, this is more of "bokeh" instead of "soft focus", nonetheless a shot to be proud of.', '2008-05-14 18:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
