(4703277, 678636, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the scene as it has a real feel to it. I am also a fan of the foreground elements being used to frame the subject. The only thing I would have changed is the left crop. I see the area left of the tree as dead space and would have personally cropped the image at mid trunk. That would form a barrier that keeps the viewer''s eye from wondering off the edge of the photo.</td>', 'I like the scene as it has a real feel to it. I am also a fan of the foreground elements being used to frame the subject. The only thing I would have changed is the left crop. I see the area left of the tree as dead space and would have personally cropped the image at mid trunk. That would form a barrier that keeps the viewer''s eye from wondering off the edge of the photo.', '2008-05-14 23:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703282, 677848, 12661, '<td valign="top">The foreground is very well done and the image appears spontaneous and unrehearsed. However, the trees in the background are distracting to me. The way the come out from behind their heads look like antlers, especially the girl on the right.</td>', 'The foreground is very well done and the image appears spontaneous and unrehearsed. However, the trees in the background are distracting to me. The way the come out from behind their heads look like antlers, especially the girl on the right.', '2008-05-14 23:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
