(4703318, 677665, 39967, '<td valign="top">Very nice soft focus on the background and edges of the flower on the foreground - good work with DOF.<br/> <br/>The warmer tones and white against the green background makes the subjects to stand out. <br/> <br/>It may lack a bit of wow factor but nonetheless still it''s a great macro shot displaying a good eye for detail.<br/> <br/>Overall the combination of technique, right exposure with good DOF &amp; colours make the shot. 8</td>', 'Very nice soft focus on the background and edges of the flower on the foreground - good work with DOF. The warmer tones and white against the green background makes the subjects to stand out.  It may lack a bit of wow factor but nonetheless still it''s a great macro shot displaying a good eye for detail. Overall the combination of technique, right exposure with good DOF & colours make the shot. 8', '2008-05-15 00:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703324, 678619, 39967, '<td valign="top">Creative shot. Simple approach creating a nice atmosphere. However I feel the white area on the right is a bit overexpose which impacts the balance of the photo.</td>', 'Creative shot. Simple approach creating a nice atmosphere. However I feel the white area on the right is a bit overexpose which impacts the balance of the photo.', '2008-05-15 00:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703337, 678507, 39967, '<td valign="top">Minimalist. Impressive macroshot. Very creative. Well compose with the lines at the back directing the eye to the area in focus. Instigating shot.<br/> <br/>I''d remove the thin lines at the top and bottom of the image; they are not needed.</td>', 'Minimalist. Impressive macroshot. Very creative. Well compose with the lines at the back directing the eye to the area in focus. Instigating shot. I''d remove the thin lines at the top and bottom of the image; they are not needed.', '2008-05-15 00:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703340, 677450, 39967, '<td valign="top">Evenly lit subject.<br/>I believe this photo could be improved with a different white balance setting to make the colours warmer.<br/> <br/>Background is too interfiring; a shallower depth of field would''ve helped.</td>', 'Evenly lit subject.I believe this photo could be improved with a different white balance setting to make the colours warmer. Background is too interfiring; a shallower depth of field would''ve helped.', '2008-05-15 00:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
