(4703546, 678652, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like how the pillars frame the shot. Moving to the left a bit with have removed the black of the left hand window though.<br/>The sepia works well with the soft mood you are trying to capture. The model''s dress works well with the soft focus concept as well. Her pose is unfortunately a little stiff. It would also be nice if her hand was motionless when you snapped the shot as the motion blur is a little distracting. <br/> <br/>And the title? You aren''t taking a picture of Ellie May so the Clampett title doesn''t work here.</td>', 'I like how the pillars frame the shot. Moving to the left a bit with have removed the black of the left hand window though.The sepia works well with the soft mood you are trying to capture. The model''s dress works well with the soft focus concept as well. Her pose is unfortunately a little stiff. It would also be nice if her hand was motionless when you snapped the shot as the motion blur is a little distracting.  And the title? You aren''t taking a picture of Ellie May so the Clampett title doesn''t work here.', '2008-05-15 02:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703547, 678546, 66515, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image and a subject that suits this challenge well. Well captured!</td>', 'Fantastic image and a subject that suits this challenge well. Well captured!', '2008-05-15 02:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
