(4703549, 677664, 66515, '<td valign="top">Pretty sharp for soft focus. That aside I would have tried to use a reflector to fill in some of the more shadowed areas. With less contrast this would have naturally appeared softer.</td>', 'Pretty sharp for soft focus. That aside I would have tried to use a reflector to fill in some of the more shadowed areas. With less contrast this would have naturally appeared softer.', '2008-05-15 02:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703550, 677638, 66515, '<td valign="top">More out of focus than soft focus. Tough difference to quantify but this one edged over to the wrong side of the line<br/> <br/>I do however, like the colors in the shot, the composition and the expression you captured. I hope you took one that was in sharp focus too!</td>', 'More out of focus than soft focus. Tough difference to quantify but this one edged over to the wrong side of the line I do however, like the colors in the shot, the composition and the expression you captured. I hope you took one that was in sharp focus too!', '2008-05-15 02:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703583, 678563, 54634, '<td valign="top">beautiful image none the less, focus a bit sharp on the flower, i wish u had done this image for any other challnege, super colors, just love it</td>', 'beautiful image none the less, focus a bit sharp on the flower, i wish u had done this image for any other challnege, super colors, just love it', '2008-05-15 03:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703615, 676963, 49643, '<td valign="top">Cute baby,nice  dress &amp; location. But unfortunately the over saturation of green color is really not working. Slightly looks tilted towards right,a tighter cropping from top may add to composition.</td>', 'Cute baby,nice  dress & location. But unfortunately the over saturation of green color is really not working. Slightly looks tilted towards right,a tighter cropping from top may add to composition.', '2008-05-15 03:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703629, 677841, 39967, '<td valign="top">The sun and the subject are very strong elements competing between them. It''s not clear where I should be looking as the plant has a prominent position but the sun has a stronger presence.<br/> <br/>This photo could work well without the sun in the frame and with a bit more depth of field.</td>', 'The sun and the subject are very strong elements competing between them. It''s not clear where I should be looking as the plant has a prominent position but the sun has a stronger presence. This photo could work well without the sun in the frame and with a bit more depth of field.', '2008-05-15 03:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703633, 678152, 39967, '<td valign="top">Very intrguing an unusual subject and framing which makes it an interesting composition. <br/> <br/>Nice balance of light and shade; to make it better, the white areas are not overexposed and it''s still possible to see details on the dark areas around the middle of the flower.</td>', 'Very intrguing an unusual subject and framing which makes it an interesting composition.  Nice balance of light and shade; to make it better, the white areas are not overexposed and it''s still possible to see details on the dark areas around the middle of the flower.', '2008-05-15 04:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703639, 677314, 39967, '<td valign="top">It was a nice intention to have your main subject sharp with blurred alements at the foreground and background. This could''ve been a good shot but there are quite a few technical issues. <br/> <br/>The light is too harsh; a warmer and lower angled light (from early or late on the day) would probably have given this picture the wow factor.<br/> <br/>Be careful with tilted horizon. If you make it tilted, make it clear that it was intentional to give the shot a bit of an edge or drama.</td>', 'It was a nice intention to have your main subject sharp with blurred alements at the foreground and background. This could''ve been a good shot but there are quite a few technical issues.  The light is too harsh; a warmer and lower angled light (from early or late on the day) would probably have given this picture the wow factor. Be careful with tilted horizon. If you make it tilted, make it clear that it was intentional to give the shot a bit of an edge or drama.', '2008-05-15 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703643, 678576, 39967, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. The overexposed sky on the background works quite well with those small darler patches that balance well with the shapes of the car and the guy.<br/> <br/>All lines on this photo leading the eye to a centered focal point. Nicely composed.<br/> <br/>Simple (but creative nonetheless) and well executed.</td>', 'Nice tones. The overexposed sky on the background works quite well with those small darler patches that balance well with the shapes of the car and the guy. All lines on this photo leading the eye to a centered focal point. Nicely composed. Simple (but creative nonetheless) and well executed.', '2008-05-15 04:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703694, 678251, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and a wonderful bokeh! Love also the composition</td>', 'beautiful colors and a wonderful bokeh! Love also the composition', '2008-05-15 05:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4703709, 678576, 93600, '<td valign="top">I would call this one "perfectionist lover"</td>', 'I would call this one "perfectionist lover"', '2008-05-15 07:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
