(4703714, 677665, 58272, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, the composition and DOF compliment the image. The colours are very nice too, I would also be interested to see this as a B&amp;W image, though.</td>', 'This is very nice, the composition and DOF compliment the image. The colours are very nice too, I would also be interested to see this as a B&W image, though.', '2008-05-15 07:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
