(4703816, 678092, 79955, '<td valign="top">the image quality is not where it should be. Cropped too much. The shadows areas &amp; highlights are too contrasty. Focus is also off &amp; the graininess in the image could be reduced. PM me if you would like another take on this image.</td>', 'the image quality is not where it should be. Cropped too much. The shadows areas & highlights are too contrasty. Focus is also off & the graininess in the image could be reduced. PM me if you would like another take on this image.', '2008-05-15 09:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
