(4709239, 677105, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  The only two real nit-picks I have are, would like to have seen more grapes to balance out that wonderful bunch of lilacs and an adjustment of the fabric and/or crop at the bottom near to the folds in it.  Maybe a little tweaking in the colorings to give it a little more depth/something, not sure.  Certainly the lilacs are beautifully displayed here in this old style cream colored jug and the soft focus works well with them (could have even gone softer and it would still transmit well, in my opinion).</td>', '8 - Very nice.  The only two real nit-picks I have are, would like to have seen more grapes to balance out that wonderful bunch of lilacs and an adjustment of the fabric and/or crop at the bottom near to the folds in it.  Maybe a little tweaking in the colorings to give it a little more depth/something, not sure.  Certainly the lilacs are beautifully displayed here in this old style cream colored jug and the soft focus works well with them (could have even gone softer and it would still transmit well, in my opinion).', '2008-05-18 06:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
