(4710092, 678583, 39967, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The soft colours with smooth background.<br/>Well exposed as the dark areas still retain a lot of detail.<br/> <br/>I particularly like the diagonal lines made by the branch in focus and the others at the back.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The soft colours with smooth background.Well exposed as the dark areas still retain a lot of detail. I particularly like the diagonal lines made by the branch in focus and the others at the back.', '2008-05-18 22:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
