(4711588, 677781, 14867, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Conveys perfectly a feeling of cold, wind, fragility. Nice pastel colors and harmonious composition - a little regret for the bright white lines, one too much. Still superb.</td>', 'Excellent. Conveys perfectly a feeling of cold, wind, fragility. Nice pastel colors and harmonious composition - a little regret for the bright white lines, one too much. Still superb.', '2008-05-19 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
