(4711783, 677762, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nicely done.  I like the ''aged'' hands, which contrast well with the flower and the overall softness creates a good effect.  The bracelets/bangles are a nice touch too.</td>', '8 - Nicely done.  I like the ''aged'' hands, which contrast well with the flower and the overall softness creates a good effect.  The bracelets/bangles are a nice touch too.', '2008-05-19 17:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711786, 678379, 39850, '<td valign="top">The concept is good, but I think your execution needs more work - this seems out of focus and/or blurry.  The lighting needs some refinement as well.</td>', 'The concept is good, but I think your execution needs more work - this seems out of focus and/or blurry.  The lighting needs some refinement as well.', '2008-05-19 17:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711793, 677994, 39850, '<td valign="top">Good perspective - more refined crop, especially bottom left and upper right and a whisker nudge up on the right to straighten make this even better in my opinion - tones work well and the softness enhances the image - there''s a bit of grain/noise, but that doesn''t work against this image necessarily, in my opinion.  Felt like I was back in time, when I first viewed the image.</td>', 'Good perspective - more refined crop, especially bottom left and upper right and a whisker nudge up on the right to straighten make this even better in my opinion - tones work well and the softness enhances the image - there''s a bit of grain/noise, but that doesn''t work against this image necessarily, in my opinion.  Felt like I was back in time, when I first viewed the image.', '2008-05-19 17:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711796, 677536, 39850, '<td valign="top">Quite a nice composition, colors are also nice - but (and especially for this Challenge), like to see this much softer, which I think would also enhance this image.  Some <i>slight</i> blur, which the softness would disguise as well, likely.</td>', 'Quite a nice composition, colors are also nice - but (and especially for this Challenge), like to see this much softer, which I think would also enhance this image.  Some slight blur, which the softness would disguise as well, likely.', '2008-05-19 17:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4711797, 678364, 39850, '<td valign="top">The softness works well, but the composition could be improved, in my opinion.</td>', 'The softness works well, but the composition could be improved, in my opinion.', '2008-05-19 17:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
