(4712489, 678442, 53594, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus, beautiful composition and subject. Her forearms are a little washed out in the highlights but a winner in my book. I am new at this and would love to know what technique you used to achieve the uniform silky smoothness of your subject.</td>', 'Sharp focus, beautiful composition and subject. Her forearms are a little washed out in the highlights but a winner in my book. I am new at this and would love to know what technique you used to achieve the uniform silky smoothness of your subject.', '2008-05-20 02:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
