(4712566, 677314, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and good potential here - a variation in the crop/composition would produce a much stronger image in my opinion.  Even softer too, for this Challenge.</td>', 'Nice capture and good potential here - a variation in the crop/composition would produce a much stronger image in my opinion.  Even softer too, for this Challenge.', '2008-05-20 07:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712569, 677826, 39850, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image that the softness has definately enhanced - look like tiny flowers.  Nice colors.  I imagine this is your chosen crop and composition, but I can''t help but think that the balance is a little ''out'' - mainly because the areas in focus are on the center and left side of the frame and they form more of a square ''shape'' than horizontal, but then there are the oof flowers in the rear... a tricky crop.</td>', 'Beautiful image that the softness has definately enhanced - look like tiny flowers.  Nice colors.  I imagine this is your chosen crop and composition, but I can''t help but think that the balance is a little ''out'' - mainly because the areas in focus are on the center and left side of the frame and they form more of a square ''shape'' than horizontal, but then there are the oof flowers in the rear... a tricky crop.', '2008-05-20 07:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4712572, 678567, 39850, '<td valign="top">Well done for Basic Editing - like the ''ghosting'' effect.  Nice also with the green left bottom right - nice detail there too.</td>', 'Well done for Basic Editing - like the ''ghosting'' effect.  Nice also with the green left bottom right - nice detail there too.', '2008-05-20 07:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
