(4712577, 678236, 39850, '<td valign="top">Very nice - beautiful natural colors and the bird has good camouflage, the softening works well.  Looks like a quality image, so the detail lost at this size is likely there ''wall sized''.</td>', 'Very nice - beautiful natural colors and the bird has good camouflage, the softening works well.  Looks like a quality image, so the detail lost at this size is likely there ''wall sized''.', '2008-05-20 07:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
