(4714026, 676963, 29011, '<td valign="top">My top3 fave. Good luck! :)<br/>A wonderful angelic shot. What a sweatie pie. Only nitpick is the bright highlights of the skirt but it''s basic editing, so I see how it can be a toughy to apply whole shot contrast adjustments. Any tips you might have on the PP or how you achieved the softness would be an appreciated read. Thanks m8.</td>', 'My top3 fave. Good luck! :)A wonderful angelic shot. What a sweatie pie. Only nitpick is the bright highlights of the skirt but it''s basic editing, so I see how it can be a toughy to apply whole shot contrast adjustments. Any tips you might have on the PP or how you achieved the softness would be an appreciated read. Thanks m8.', '2008-05-21 02:46:22.000000', NULL, 0),
