(4716727, 677648, 75532, '<td valign="top">Ok well I don''t know how to edit the text under my picture so anyhow, i actually ended up adopting this one myself as no one wanted to take him home- poor thing! He was a bully and a hyperactive kitty, however now that he is with me at home he is the best :)  I know the picture is dull, it needs more umph but it was a last minute thing just to see what would happen :)</td>', 'Ok well I don''t know how to edit the text under my picture so anyhow, i actually ended up adopting this one myself as no one wanted to take him home- poor thing! He was a bully and a hyperactive kitty, however now that he is with me at home he is the best :)  I know the picture is dull, it needs more umph but it was a last minute thing just to see what would happen :)', '2008-05-22 00:44:23.000000', NULL, 0),
